                <mxCell id="pag0_49" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.55&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#0A4AAD&quot;&gt;Princ&amp;#237;pio central da arquitetura&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;O plano anal&amp;#237;tico &amp;#233; o c&amp;#233;rebro, &lt;b&gt;nunca o runtime do site&lt;/b&gt;. Se o pipeline falhar, o site continua no ar servindo a &amp;#250;ltima vers&amp;#227;o publicada. Nenhum request de usu&amp;#225;rio atravessa o plano anal&amp;#237;tico &amp;#8212; por isso trocar o motor de dados custa &lt;b&gt;um&lt;/b&gt; componente.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1F2733;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;labelPosition=center;verticalLabelPosition=middle;spacing=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
